            <div xml:id="errata">

                <pb facs="0772" n="748" xml:id="pg748"/>

                <head>Errata</head>
                <p>The following changes have been made to <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign
                        Relations</hi>, 1955–1957, Volume XIX, National Security Policy. Please be
                    aware that printed volumes have not been revised.
                    <!--Revised information is in italic.-->
                </p>
                <list type="simple">
                    <item>
                        <hi rendition="#bold"> 1. Footnote 2, <ref target="#d30">Document 30</ref>,
                            Page 95 (date of correction: May 8, 2017)</hi>
                    </item>
                    <item>The citation to “footnote 4, Document 17” has been corrected to “footnote
                        3, Document 17.”</item>
                    <item>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">2. Footnote 4, <ref target="#d90">Document 90</ref>,
                            Page 361 (date of correction: May 8, 2017)</hi>
                    </item>
                    <item>The citation to “footnote 4, Document 17” has been corrected to “footnote
                        3, Document 17.”</item>
                    <item>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">2. Footnote 6, <ref target="#d92">Document 92</ref>,
                            Page 367 (date of correction: May 8, 2017)</hi>
                    </item>
                    <item>The citation to “footnote 4, Document 17” has been corrected to “footnote
                        3, Document 17.”</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
